Dear StormC customer,

you will find new linker libraries and a new AppManger library in
these drawers.

Please copy the contents of the drawer "Mathlibs" to
"StormC:StormSYS/lib" and the contents of the drawer "Lib" to
"StormC:Lib" and the contents of "StormSYS" to "StormC:StormSYS".


Best wishes
HAAGE&PARTNER Support Team


=========================================================
THESE FILES CAN ONLY BE USED WITH VERSION 2 OF STORMC !!!
=========================================================



Changes on AppManager.library
====================================

19.11.96

Repeated opening of a Wizard window brought up strange effects on
the size of the next window. It was always the size of the biggest
one opened.


Changes on Linker library
=====================================

19.11.96

- Correction of the "strstr" function.

- Several changes on the parsing of arguments.


